            // About
            section#about.resume-section
                .resume-section-content
                    h1.mb-0
                        | Vidushi
                        span.text-primary Toshniwal
                    .subheading.mb-5
                        | Department of Geoscience and Geo-Engineering · TU Delft, NL
                    p.lead.mb-5
                        | I am pursuing my Ph.D. under the supervision of 
                        a(href='https://www.tudelft.nl/en/staff/m.a.hicks/', target='_blank') Prof. Dr. Michael Hicks
                        | , 
                        a(href='https://www.tudelft.nl/en/staff/w.broere/', target='_blank') Dr.ir. Wout Broere
                        | , and 
                        a(href='https://www.tudelft.nl/en/staff/a.c.dieudonne/', target='_blank') Dr.ir. Anne-Catherine Dieudonné
                        | . My research focuses on geomechanics, particularly the time-dependent hydro-mechanical behavior of geomaterials in context of deep geological disposal of high-level radioactive waste.
                        br
                        br
                        | My research interests lie at the intersection of computational methods and experimental soil behavior, with practical applications. I have gained valuable research experiences at 
                        a(href='https://www.purdue.edu/', target='_blank') Purdue University
                        |  and 
                        a(href='https://www.rowan.edu/', target='_blank') Rowan University
                        |  in the USA and 
                        a(href='https://www.uni-hannover.de/', target='_blank') Leibniz University, Hannover
                        | , DE. I have also been fortunate to gain industry experience through internship at 
                        a(href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SLB', target='_blank') Schlumberger
                        | , India.
                        br
                        br
                        | I come from Kota, a city widely known as an education hub in India. My academic journey began with a dual degree from 
                        a(href='https://home.iitd.ac.in/') IIT Delhi
                        |  with bachelors in Civil engineering and masters in Geotechnical and Geo-environmental engineering. My master's thesis focused on study of offshore monopile foundations behavior under cyclic loading. Apart from soils, theatre and painting excites me! I also enjoy engaging in community service activities and contributing to graduate school organisations through various leadership roles.
